Third round committed. Here's a summary of the 8 files improved:

| File | Changes |
|---|---|
| `DurationConverter.java` | `trim().isEmpty()` → `isBlank()`; `Pattern.asPredicate().test()` → `matcher().matches()` on all 4 patterns (avoids throwaway `Predicate` allocation per call) |
| `EnvUtil.java` | `StringBuffer` → `StringBuilder`; synchronization is unnecessary for a method-local buffer; `Matcher.appendReplacement` accepts `StringBuilder` since Java 9 |
| `KeyUtils.java` | Removed intermediate `KeyPair keyPair` variable in `generateRsaKeyPair`; also trimmed trailing whitespace |
| `MimeTypeUtil.java` | Added missing `final` to the static `MimetypesFileTypeMap` field (written once in static initializer, never reassigned) |
| `PathMatcher.java` | `split("\\/")` → `split("/")` (/ is not a regex metacharacter); `"".equals(s)` → `s.isEmpty()`; `String.valueOf(char[]).substring(0,n)` → `new String(char[], 0, n)` (avoids constructing the full string before truncating); `indexOf("{") != -1` → `contains("{")` |
| `StringPropertyReplacer.java` | `bytes.toString(StandardCharsets.UTF_8.name())` → `bytes.toString(StandardCharsets.UTF_8)` (Charset overload available since Java 10, no `.name()` needed) |
| `KeyPairVerifier.java` | `"content".getBytes()` → `"content".getBytes(StandardCharsets.UTF_8)` — avoids platform-default charset dependency |
| `TokenVerifier.java` | Removed obsolete JDK 7 comment; activated `@FunctionalInterface`; removed redundant `static` on nested interface; dropped `.toString()` call on list in string concatenation (implicit) |

